# 7. Don't try to make the first evaluator “correct”

This is fundamental.

Your first AssessorVersion can be:

```text
assessor/submission/v0
```

with:

```text
G0 eligibility/hard requirements
G1 actual integration evidence
G2 technical execution
G3 opportunity fit
G4 novelty
G5 completeness
G6 pitch/demo quality
```

But tag each signal:

```text
truth_type:
  deterministic
  environment
  external
  model_judge
```

For example:

```yaml
required_api_called:
  kind: deterministic
  weight: hard_gate

tests_pass:
  kind: deterministic

technical_quality:
  kind: model_judge

novelty:
  kind: model_judge

actual_rank:
  kind: external
```

That prevents:

```text
LLM score = truth
```

from entering the Lab.

