# 8. Regrade should become a first-class Moltwork command immediately

I'd make this one of the first real CGE features:

```bash
mw regrade C001 \
  --assessor assessor/submission/v2
```

Underneath it should mostly call:

```bash
harbor job regrade ...
```

Harbor already does the difficult part: it preserves the original agent configuration, artifacts, recorded costs and provenance while rerunning only the verifier. ([Harbor][2])

Then Hydra gets:

```text
Run R1
 ├── Evaluation E1 / Assessor v1
 ├── Evaluation E2 / Assessor v2
 ├── Evaluation E3 / Assessor v3
 └── ExternalOutcome O1
```

This alone could produce hugely valuable experiments before you touch worker evolution.

